		(property "Description" "RES 620k 1% 0603 AEC-Q200 - OTP FB shunt, DNP. Fit only to program BQ79616 OTP: 180k||620k = 139.5k raises the rail to 11.1V, V_collector 10.6V worst case vs the 8V LDOIN OTP level. Remove after programming - 11V rail exceeds the 9V LDOIN abs max if Q201 ever saturates"
